{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Do not retain suspended executions indefinitely**\n\nA PENDING/RETRYING execution may resume in another Lambda environment, so this warm container may never observe its terminal event and `byArn` grows without bound\u2014even when sampling is disabled. Each new invocation already supplies the stable execution start time and input. Remove state on every invocation end and recreate it at the next start, or use a bounded expiry strategy; test a paired suspend/resume lifecycle.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7nh9ZY","finding_digest":"81fd7700b9c9379d8846885efa09946c49ace09f497eb0f942fa0322d2f664bb","finding_id":"arf_v1_qh6xoafzze3z3ccgrbppucmunr","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.oninvocationend::nonterminal-state-retention","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.oninvocationend::nonterminal-state-retention","line":174,"observation_digest":"4e49a9ec2a9135bbb2d9a091f7d8f2d4d9022b38e9d97de7eaff06c4f90b057e","observation_id":"aro_v1_jze2t3bkse23xmwzuci7pwhs2t","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-08-28T22:27:03Z","review_id":"arr_v1_5xididmhluq4mhdhugntjpm257","reviewed_base_sha":"6501c39f553655583e33238eb1d821e4f44b8e26","reviewed_head_sha":"bdbd88fcdf777f50567d968c0e73fa11c8eb39ad","reviewer":"codex","start_line":173,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_4qfk4htgyozm2o6z5pwcy4jewr","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-08-28T22:27:03Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
